  "question": {
    "text": "&lsquo; <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> &rsquo; melts at low temperature and is a bad conductor of electricity in both liquid and solid state. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> is:",
